{{PageBanner|Clb l 012 2 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular anime known as '''Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel''' was  originally held from October 30th, 2017 to November 13th, 2017. The collaboration includes an [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The anime is produced by Ufotable.

==Event Information==
